flowchart TD
  PR[GitHub Pull Request] --> NodeBuild[.github/actions/node-build]
  NodeBuild --> NpmCI[npm ci]
  NpmCI --> Build[npm run build]
  Build --> Docker[Dockerfile]
  Docker --> Static[copy build to /usr/share/nginx/html/admin]
  Docker --> Entrypoint[scripts/docker-entrypoint.sh]
  Entrypoint --> EnvJS[write runtime env.js]
  EnvJS --> Nginx[nginx serves /admin]
